{"id":"nagel","lemma":"Nagel","pos":"noun","rank":3799,"glosses":["A nail, the horny plate on fingers and toes of humans and certain animals which mostly consists of keratin.","A nail, a man-made pointed fastener used for joining different materials by penetrating them."],"ipa":"/ˈnaːɡəl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/70/De-Nagel.ogg/De-Nagel.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Nagels","plural":"Nägel"},"examples":[{"text":"Ihre Nägel sind rot.","en":"Her nails are red.","words":[{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"red"}]},{"text":"Gib mir noch einen Nagel.","en":"Give me another nail.","words":[{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"a","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Ich brauche eine Kiste Nägel.","en":"I need a box of nails.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"chest, box"},null]},{"text":"Der Nagel ging durch die Wand.","en":"The nail went through the wall.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"by means of"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"wall, partition"}]},{"text":"Schlag den Nagel ein.","en":"Hammer the nail in.","words":[{"g":"blow, hit"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"a"}]}]}